      "title": "Organize a thread",
      "description": "Pin, snooze, settle, archive, or mark a thread unread. Omit `threadId` for this thread. `snooze` needs `snoozedUntil`. Settling this thread applies at turn end. A failed turn or queued message leaves it active.",
